    "title": "Mark Satin",
    "text": "Mark Ivor Satin is an American political theorist, writer, and newsletter publisher. He is best known for contributing to the development and dissemination of three political perspectives – neopacifism in the 1960s, New Age politics in the 1970s and 1980s, and radical centrism from the 1990s into the 2020s. Satin's work is sometimes seen as building toward a new political ideology, and then it is often labeled \"transformational\", \"post-liberal\", or \"post-Marxist\". One historian calls Satin's writing \"post-hip\".",
